1
00:05:45,882 --> 00:05:51,882
Evil rises from the depths of hell.

2
00:11:31,764 --> 00:11:37,764
Faust: Love of the Damned is a horror, fantasy,
action film directed by Brian Yuzna.

3
00:17:17,647 --> 00:17:23,647
An artist sells his soul to the mysterious M in order to get
revenge on the people who killed his girlfriend.

4
00:23:03,529 --> 00:23:09,529
Soon, he realises everything has a price, and he is transformed
into a horned demon with a passion for killing.

5
