11
01:03:24,705 --> 01:03:30,705
Faust: Love of the Damned (Title in Spain: Faust: La venganza está en la sangre) is a 2000
Spanish English-language superhero horror film directed by Brian Yuzna.

12
01:09:10,588 --> 01:09:16,588
It is adapted from a screenplay by David Quinn and Miguel Tejada-Flores based on
the comic book of the same name by Tim Vigil and David Quinn.

13
01:14:56,470 --> 01:15:02,470
It was produced by Ted Chalmers, Carlos Fernández Rodríguez, Julio Fernández Rodríguez
and Antonio Fernández, Bea Morillas, Miguel Torrente and Brian Yuzna.

14
01:20:42,352 --> 01:20:48,352
The film, which was the first of nine to be produced by Filmax's Fantastic Factory label, won the award
for Best Special Effects at the 2000 Catalan International Film Festival in Sitges, Spain.

15
01:26:28,235 --> 01:26:34,235
The film explores themes of rape, snake, magic, gangster, cemetery.

16
01:32:14,117 --> 01:32:20,117
The tone is dark.
